setup: something behaves differently when it's the first process in a pid namespace and you need to reproduce that here
q: {`unshare` a new pid namespace, forking so the shell is pid 1|fork into a new pid namespace with `unshare`, shell as pid 1|`unshare` a pid namespace and fork, so the shell lands as pid 1}
